  "verdict": "null",
  "notes": "Mean donation amounts differ by less than 2 GBP across night-use bands, the correlation is essentially zero (-0.0009, p=0.81), and in a model adjusting for income the night-use bands have non-significant, small coefficients (p>0.1).",
